              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <h2 class="mt-14 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
            What each stocked tank really delivers
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Every one of these is sold by its shell volume. At 30/50 with a correct pre-charge, this is the
            water you get — and the run time it buys a {base.pumpGpm} gpm pump.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
            <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-500 bg-slate-50">
                  <th class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold">Tank sold as</th>
                  <th class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold">Drawdown at 30/50</th>
                  <th class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold">Run time at {base.pumpGpm} gpm</th>
